      "dutt": "SuTA said, — “The Lord, desirous of creation, first assumed the form of Purusha composed of sixteen elements,-— out of seven other subtle elements, Mahat ( intelligence ), etc.; ( the others being egoism and the five subtile rudiments of matter)."
